devilica.options.hud_caching.tooltip=Draws the HUD once a game tick (20 times a second) and reuses it between, which saves frame time with busy HUDs. Animations on the HUD then move at 20 frames a second.
devilica.options.batch_block_entities=Batch Block Entities
devilica.options.batch_block_entities.tooltip=Draws closed chests, ender chests and signs together, one draw for each texture instead of one for each block. One that opens, breaks or comes from a mod that changes it draws itself as usual.
devilica.options.better_snow=Better Snow
devilica.options.better_snow.tooltip=Snow also lies under grass, flowers, fences and the like that stand in snow, so it has no holes around them.
devilica.options.render_scale=Shader Render Scale
devilica.options.render_scale.tooltip=With a shader pack, the world is drawn at this share of the window's resolution and stretched to it. Lower is faster and blurrier; the interface stays sharp.
devilica.options.fsr=FSR Upscaling
devilica.options.fsr.tooltip=With a render scale below 100%, stretch the world with AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1, which keeps edges sharper than plain stretching.
devilica.options.fsr_sharpness=FSR Sharpness
devilica.options.fsr_sharpness.tooltip=How much FSR sharpens the stretched world.
devilica.options.pages.overlay=Overlay
devilica.options.overlay_fps=Show FPS
devilica.options.overlay_fps.tooltip=Frames per second in a corner of the screen.
devilica.options.overlay_fps_extended=Average and Lows
devilica.options.overlay_fps_extended.tooltip=Next to the FPS, the average over the last ten seconds and the frame rates of its slowest 1% and 0.1% of frames, which show stutter better than the average.
devilica.options.overlay_coordinates=Show Coordinates
devilica.options.overlay_coordinates.tooltip=Where the camera is, in a corner of the screen.
devilica.options.overlay_memory=Show Memory
devilica.options.overlay_memory.tooltip=How much of the game's memory is in use, in a corner of the screen.
devilica.options.overlay_corner=Overlay Corner
devilica.options.overlay_corner.tooltip=The corner of the screen the overlay sits in.
devilica.options.overlay_corner.top_left=Top Left
devilica.options.overlay_corner.top_right=Top Right
devilica.options.overlay_corner.bottom_left=Bottom Left
devilica.options.overlay_corner.bottom_right=Bottom Right
devilica.options.text_contrast=Text Contrast
devilica.options.text_contrast.tooltip=What keeps the overlay's text readable on a bright world: nothing, a dark background, or a shadow.
devilica.options.text_contrast.none=None
devilica.options.text_contrast.background=Background
devilica.options.text_contrast.shadow=Shadow
devilica.options.debug_refresh=F3 Refresh
devilica.options.debug_refresh.tooltip=How often the F3 screen's text is worked out again. Every frame, as vanilla, costs frame time while F3 is open.
devilica.options.every_frame=Every frame
devilica.options.milliseconds=%s ms
devilica.options.adaptive_vsync=Adaptive VSync
devilica.options.adaptive_vsync.tooltip=With VSync on, a frame that comes late shows at once instead of waiting for the next refresh, so the frame rate does not drop to half. It can tear then. Drivers that lack it keep plain VSync.
devilica.options.toasts=Pop-ups
devilica.options.toasts.tooltip=The pop-ups in the top right corner: advancements, recipes, tutorial hints and the like.
devilica.options.advancement_toasts=Advancement Pop-ups
devilica.options.advancement_toasts.tooltip=The pop-up for a new advancement.
devilica.options.recipe_toasts=Recipe Pop-ups
devilica.options.recipe_toasts.tooltip=The pop-up for newly unlocked recipes.
devilica.options.system_toasts=System Pop-ups
devilica.options.system_toasts.tooltip=System pop-ups, such as the one about narrator keys.
devilica.options.mob_view_shaders=Mob View Effects
devilica.options.mob_view_shaders.tooltip=The tint seen through a creeper's, spider's or enderman's eyes when spectating it.
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_self=Own Light
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_self.tooltip=What you hold and wear lights up the world around you, and so does fire on you.
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_entities=Entity Lights
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_entities.tooltip=Mobs, other players, dropped items and items in frames give off light.
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_creepers=Creeper Light
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_creepers.tooltip=A creeper about to blow up glows: not at all, at one level, or brighter as it flashes.
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_tnt=TNT Light
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_tnt.tooltip=Lit TNT glows: not at all, at one level, or brighter as its fuse burns down.
devilica.options.explosive_light.off=Off
devilica.options.explosive_light.simple=Simple
devilica.options.explosive_light.fancy=Fancy
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_water=Out Under Water
devilica.options.dynamic_lights_water.tooltip=Torches, lava, fire charges, blazes and creepers give no light under water. Glowstone and the like still do.
devilica.options.colored_light=Coloured Light
devilica.options.colored_light.tooltip=Redstone glows red, sea lanterns pale blue, portals purple, lava orange. Torches and glowstone keep the game's own light. It shows at night and in caves; daylight washes it out. A shader pack draws its own.
devilica.options.pages.light_sources=Light Sources
devilica.options.light_source.tooltip=Whether %s gives off dynamic light. Kinds show up here once one is seen giving off light.
devilica.key.zoom_in=Zoom In
devilica.key.zoom_out=Zoom Out
devilica.options.zoom_scroll=Scroll to Zoom
devilica.options.zoom_scroll.tooltip=While zoomed, the mouse wheel zooms in and out instead of changing the hotbar slot.
devilica.options.zoom_default=Starting Zoom
devilica.options.zoom_default.tooltip=How far the zoom goes when it starts.
devilica.options.zoom_sensitivity_floor=Mouse Sensitivity Floor
devilica.options.zoom_sensitivity_floor.tooltip=The mouse slows down as you zoom in, but not below this share of its usual speed.
devilica.options.zoom_toggle=Toggle Zoom
devilica.options.zoom_toggle.tooltip=In first person, a press of the key turns the zoom on and the next one off, instead of holding the key.
devilica.options.zoom_third_person_toggle=Toggle Zoom in Third Person
devilica.options.zoom_third_person_toggle.tooltip=The same in third person.
devilica.options.zoom_third_person_max=Third Person Zoom
devilica.options.zoom_third_person_max.tooltip=In third person, the zoom moves the camera closer to you or further away, up to this many blocks. Off narrows the view as in first person.
devilica.options.zoom_third_person_off=Off
devilica.options.leaves.tooltip=Default follows the graphics setting. Fast: solid leaves. Fancy: see-through leaves. Smart: see-through, but the faces between two leaves are not drawn, so trees look fancy from outside with far fewer faces.
devilica.options.leaves.default=Default
devilica.options.leaves.fast=Fast
devilica.options.leaves.fancy=Fancy
devilica.options.leaves.smart=Smart
devilica.options.cloud_distance=Cloud Distance
devilica.options.cloud_distance.tooltip=How far out clouds are drawn. Beyond the fog they are not seen anyway, so less than the render distance saves drawing for nothing lost.
devilica.options.cloud_scale=Cloud Size
devilica.options.cloud_scale.tooltip=How large clouds are, from a quarter of vanilla to four times.
devilica.options.cloud_opacity=Cloud Opacity
devilica.options.cloud_opacity.tooltip=How much the clouds hide the sky behind them. Vanilla is 80%.
